    "title": "【2026Hackathon决赛】33：Java 虚拟机内联策略优化",
    "content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.6; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Java </span>虚拟机内联策略优化</span><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></b></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">一、题目名称</span></b></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">决赛赛题名称：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Java </span>虚拟机内联策略优化<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">赛题所属技术领域：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">JVM </span>即时编译器（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">JIT</span>）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">/ </span>编译器优化<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> / </span>性能工程<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">赛题限制：本赛题聚焦于<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> HotSpot JVM C2 </span>编译器的内联决策逻辑，基于<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> OpenJDK </span>开源代码，无需公司内特殊环境或保密业务数据。由于本次参赛验证机器为鲲鹏<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">CPU</span>，建议参赛者使用<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">arm</span>机器完成开发与验证。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><br></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">二、背景信息<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">微服务场景中，应用通常包含大量小函数，且调用栈较深。方法内联是提升其执行效率的常见编译优化手段之一。根据经验，不同的内联决策对最终性能影响较大，当前主要依赖人工识别并手动调整<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> JVM </span>参数进行进一步调优。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">在<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> JVM C2 </span>编译器中，方法内联（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Method Inlining</span>）将<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> callee </span>的方法体直接复制到<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> caller </span>中，并通过 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">InlineTree</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">数据结构驱动整个内联决策过程。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 22.0pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">InlineTree</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">当前使用 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">MaxInlineSize</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">FreqInlineSize</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">MaxRecursiveInlineLevel</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">、</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">MaxInlineLevel</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">等静态全局阈值进行内联决策。这些阈值均为经验值，难以适应多样化应用，亟需更优的自适应算法来调整。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">三、问题描述<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">3.1 </span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">问题拆解<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><img width=\"289\" height=\"459\" src=\"https://www.chaspark.com/chasiwu/media/v1/tinyimage/1326726800979513344.png?state=2&auth_key=1791450038-bwgsustqw2oiulrr298tne7deuh3rz0u-0-5fbf69601a5ea443be5346bdd1fd946f113823d459a68304d3d8be8508f888aa&translate_time=1791450048\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">内联决策当前考虑的决策点主要有三类：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">基础检查：当前内联决策主要依赖固定的字节码大小阈值（</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">MaxInlineSize=35</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">字节、</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">FreqInlineSize=325</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">字节）和内联深度限制（</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">MaxInlineLevel</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">）。这些静态阈值对于不同特性的应用（如微服务、大数据处理、低延迟交易系统）难以做到最优平衡。<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">节点数检查：<span>C2 </span>编译器有 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">LiveNodeCountInliningCutoff</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">和 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">MaxNodeLimit</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">限制。当<span> IR </span>图节点数接近上限时，会放弃进一步内联。但这种“全有或全无”的决策模式可能导致关键路径上的优化机会丧失。<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">递归深度检查：</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">InlineTree</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">通过回溯调用栈检测重复方法来限制递归内联深度（</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">MaxRecursiveInlineLevel</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">），但对于间接递归和非严格递归场景的处理较为粗糙，可能导致过早放弃或过度内联。<span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">从抽象概念上理解，</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">InlineTree</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">的本质是一个“带约束的树形遍历与决策问题”。其输入为调用图（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">Call Graph</span>），根节点为编译入口方法（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">caller</span>），中间节点和叶子节点为子方法，边为调用关系（含调用频率、接收者类型等信息）。输出为每条调用边的<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> 0/1 </span>二值决策值。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">整体上，本题目期望的优化目标和效果是：通过优化 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">InlineTree</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">的决策模型，提升<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> C2 </span>编译器在各类<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> Java </span>应用中的峰值性能，同时将代码膨胀控制在合理范围内。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">3.2 </span></b><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">接口定义<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"text-indent: 24.0pt; line-height: 1.6; overflow-x: auto;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">本题涉及的核心接口位于<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> OpenJDK </span>源码，参赛者需理解和修改以下关键模块：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">核心类：</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">InlineTree</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">（</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">bytecodeInfo.hpp/cpp</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">）<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">关键决策函数（待优化）：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"SourceCode\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">// bytecodeInfo.cpp </span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">核心内联检查逻辑</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><br><span class=\"DataTypeTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">bool</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> InlineTree</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">::</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">try_inline</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">(</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">ciMethod</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">*</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> callee</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">,</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span></span><span class=\"DataTypeTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">int</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> caller_bci</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">,</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span></span><br><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>JVMState</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">*</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> jvms</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">,</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> ciCallProfile</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">&amp;</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> profile</span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">)</span></span><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">{</span></span><br><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">// </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">内部实现<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> Todo</span>：</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><br><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">// 1. </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">基础编译注解动作检查（<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">native</span>、<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">abstract</span>、<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">@DontInline </span>等）</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><br><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">// 2. </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">深度检查</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><br><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">// 3. </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">递归检查</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><br><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">// 4. </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">大小检查</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><br><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">// 5. </span></span></span><span class=\"CommentTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">节点数检查</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><br><span class=\"NormalTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">......</span></span><br><span class=\"OperatorTok\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">}</span></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">四、期望达到的指标和效果<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">功能目标<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">实现优化后的 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">InlineTree::try_inline()</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">决策逻辑，基于<span> OpenJDK jdk25u-dev/jdk-25.0.3-ga</span>。<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">支持通过<span> JVM </span>参数（</span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">-XX:+PrintInlining</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">）输出详细的内联决策日志，便于分析验证。<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">算法需具有泛化性，不能指定具体函数做内联，也不能指定具体阈值。<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">如果引入<span> AI </span>模型，需要提供训练数据和训练脚本。<span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">性能目标<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">: </span>函数<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">jmh</span>单次执行时间最短<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">基准用例不回退：在至少<span> 5 </span>个代表性基准（组委会提供）上，几何平均性能不低于基线（当前<span> OpenJDK C2 </span>实现）。<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">进阶用例提升率：在<span> 5 </span>个预期场景（组委会提供）下，总运行时间相比基线提升<span> ≥ 10%</span>。<span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">稳定性指标<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">方案不得引入新的<span> JVM </span>崩溃（<span>crash</span>）或断言失败（<span>assertion failure</span>）。<span></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">内联决策应保持确定性——同一方法在相同输入下多次编译的内联结果应一致，避免 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">PrintInlining</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">输出不稳定导致测试用例失败。<span></span></span></li>\n</ol>\n<p class=\"FirstParagraph\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">五、测试用例<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">5.1 </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">输入规范<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">参赛者提交的方案需支持通过 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">-XX:+PrintInlining</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">输出内联决策日志（沿用原有内联调试日志框架），格式如下：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p class=\"SourceCode\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">@ 1<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>java.lang.String::length (5 bytes)<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>accessor</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\"><br><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">@ 2<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>java.lang.StringBuffer::append (13 bytes)<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>inline (hot)</span></span><br><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">@ 3<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>com.example.ExpensiveMethod::compute (150 bytes)<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>failed to inline: size &gt; DesiredMethodLimit</span></span><br><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">@ 4<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>com.example.Recursive::factorial (20 bytes)<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>failed to inline: recursively inlining too deep</span></span><br><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">@ 5<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>com.example.LambdaTarget::apply (25 bytes)<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>inline (hot)<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>late inline succeeded</span></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">5.2 </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">基础测试用例集<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">包括但不限于以下几种内联场景：大小阈值拒绝、递归深度限制、热路径动态阈值、<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">IR </span>节点数限制等。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">六、评选标准<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></b></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">验收机型：鲲鹏 <span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">920</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">提交方式：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">JDK 25.0.3 </span>的<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> patch </span>及构建脚本；如有<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> AI </span>模型，需提供模型的数据集及训练脚本（训练时长需小于<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> 1 </span>小时）。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">JDK </span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">软件构建约束：<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">gcc 10.3.1</span>，<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\">glibc 2.34</span>，构建方式为 </span><span class=\"VerbatimChar\" style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">bash configure ; make images</span></span><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">；构建脚本不允许修改现有<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"> JDK </span>模块的配置。<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"><span style=\"font-family: '微软雅黑',sans-serif;\">评分维度<span style=\"line-height: 1.6;\"></span></span></p>\n<table class=\"Table data-preserve-origin-style\" bord